<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DON GROUP RENEWS CAUTIONARY OVER TALKS.</title>
<headline>DON GROUP RENEWS CAUTIONARY OVER TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Don Group Ltd on Friday said negotiations were continuing which, if successfully concluded, could affect the price of Don shares.</p>
<p>The group first advised shareholders to exercise caution due to the talks on April 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
